Some stuff I've made. Currently a static site rendered with React Router 7 (fmr Remix).

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev
pnpm new-post "Initial Title Goes Here"
```

Pushing to main will trigger a build+deploy via github actions.

Features:

- markdown code snippets automatically formatted/wrapped to the narrow layout (oxfmt)
- inter-post relative markdown links are automatically turned into site links
- frontmatter is linted against a schema (eslint + vendored plugin + zod-generated schema)
